# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Web environment (apps/web). Copy to .env.local if you need to override.
# Defaults work out of the box for local dev.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of the Hono API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Clerk auth on the client. Set the publishable key to turn on real sign-in:
# the landing CTA and nav switch to Clerk's sign-up/sign-in modals + UserButton,
# and every API request carries a Bearer JWT instead of the dev header. With no
# key set, the app runs in dev-auth mode (a per-browser dev user) — zero setup.
# Pair this with CLERK_JWT_ISSUER/CLERK_JWKS_URL on the API so it verifies the JWT.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_...
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_...   # used by the Next proxy (proxy.ts) in Clerk mode
